See definitions of &#8220;large accelerated filer&#8221;, &#8220;accelerated filer,&#8221; &#8220;smaller reporting company&#8221; and
&#8220;emerging growth company&#8221; in Rule 12b-2 of the Exchange Act.</p><div>

