  </table></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; ">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationSeparatelyRecognizedTransactionsTableTextBlock" id="ixv-4243"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; ">The number of shares
of common stock issued immediately following the consummation of the Merger were:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; ">&#160;</p>

