<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The total fair value of the Series A Warrants
and Series B Warrants measured at issuance was $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c122" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FairValueAdjustmentOfWarrants" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-7369">12,656,550</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c123" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FairValueAdjustmentOfWarrants" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-7370">82,450</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

